{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDYpJiQuSt9NMiQBf6fh", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "驾驶员是 **Thomas Yates**,McMurtry Automotive 的联合创始人兼董事总经理。这次演示在英国格洛斯特郡的 McMurtry 总部进行。\n\n各来源对细节的说法略有出入:\n- **日期**:Wikipedia 和 Top Gear 写的是 2025 年 4 月 11 日,IMechE 写的是 4 月 10 日。\n- **倒挂时长**:Wikipedia 说约 5 秒,IMechE 说缓慢前移了 7 秒。\n\nSpéirling 先开上一个坡道,再上到一个会旋转的平台,平台把车整个翻转过来。车靠风扇系统产生的downforce(下压力)吸附在平台上。IMechE 称这套系统在不前进的情况下也能产生约 2,000 kg 的下压力。\n\nSources:\n- [McMurtry Spéirling – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/McMurtry_Sp%C3%A9irling)\n- [Top Gear: McMurtry Spéirling first car in world to drive upside down](https://topgear.com/car-news/electric/mcmurtry-speirling-first-car-world-drive-upside-down)\n- [IMechE: How and why McMurtry made a car that can drive upside down](https://www.imeche.org/news/news-article/how-and-why-mcmurtry-made-a-car-that-can-drive-upside-down)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1216, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4306, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1216}, "output_tokens": 4, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:14:19.668Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDYpJPpEP8h9acNwFTwW"}
